text_output=The key was making sure our technology is reused. We're not building things in isolation. That's actually where we kind of used to be. So I would say, you know, we have to be real about where we are as a company. We've been trying to get our act together. We also don't have high performance GPUs, right? So all these things are kind of factors into where we are.
